        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highlandtown%2C_Baltimore"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The district earned National Register status for its working‑class settlement patterns and classic row houses.",
